{"about_the_game":"DEAD DREAMS is a story-driven, 2D psychological horror game focused on puzzle-solving and atmosphere.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1195910/extras/f33a39e692b3cc1adc52c23659ed10b7.webp?t=1667060942\" width=630 height=49 /></span><br><br>A school game dev club of four friends breaks up after the tragic death of one of their members. Until... a sinister \u2018V\u2019 would force them back to their memories of those events and how it changed their lives. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1195910/extras/62d4ecc61664faa40ee734614507d0eb.poster.avif?t=1667060942\" width=634 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1195910/extras/62d4ecc61664faa40ee734614507d0eb.webm?t=1667060942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1195910/extras/62d4ecc61664faa40ee734614507d0eb.mp4?t=1667060942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1195910/extras/4aa91b37d096aeef65ce027fb8dd83de.webp?t=1667060942\" width=630 height=49 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Every puzzle, creature and story element reflects the character's fears and dreams.<br></li><li>35+ disturbing and uncanny creature designs.<br></li><li>Multiple characters and complex non-linear story.<br></li><li>5-8 hours long.<br></li><li>Atmosphere, sound design and story inspired by the Silent Hill series.<br></li><li>Fully animated cutscenes.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1195910/extras/7e1fb